WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.530
<b>Thank You, Daddy</b>

3
00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.530
Bonney...

4
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.740
Did you see everything?

5
00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:08.960
Yes.

6
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.510
Gee...

7
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.040
I've broken my promise to Kuma.

8
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.440
Whoa...

9
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:30.030
I'm sorry, Vegapunk!

10
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.850
Give me your hand.

11
00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.290
Why?

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.690
Kuma entrusted this to me.

13
00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.780
It's a present for your tenth birthday.

14
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.030
From Daddy?! Yay!

15
00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.760
There.

16
00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.950
What a beautiful sapphire!

17
00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.540
This necklace looks like the sun!
I'll treasure it!

18
00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.520
The sun?

19
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.130
Mm-hm!

20
00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.090
The Sun God!

21
00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.970
Kuma said it was just a good-luck charm,

22
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.020
but indeed,

23
00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.180
who could have imagined two years ago...

24
00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.430
that kid would turn into
something like that?

25
00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.410
Speaking of which, Straw Hat is
Daddy's best friend's kid, isn't he?

26
00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:27.900
Yes. I was surprised
when you two arrived here together!

27
00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.920
Fate works in mysterious ways.

28
00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.610
After you went into that room,

29
00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:36.660
so much has happened on Egghead...

30
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.310
I was just saved
by Straw Hat Luffy and his crew.

31
00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:47.300
I'll tell you everything.
Let's join them once you've settled down.

32
00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:51.760
I'm sorry, Bonney.

33
00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:56.010
Sorry that I'm just
a paltry hired scientist.

34
00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.220
No.

35
00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.330
No!

36
00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.190
It's all...

37
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.940
his fault!

38
00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.070
Present Day

39
00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:08.820
Egghead, New World

40
00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.210
Dammit! Why can't I move?!

41
00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.210
Bonney!

42
00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.310
What the hell is this?!

43
00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.980
I don't know! It might be his power!

44
00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:42.660
Food...

45
00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.520
Meat...

46
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.860
Somebody... please...

47
00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:51.570
Meat...

48
00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.360
I wish I could get some for you,
but I can't move...

49
00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.490
Reporting in!

50
00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.660
we captured Vegapunk's
bodyguard, Sentomaru!

51
00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.620
Sentomaru...

52
00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:06.720
Bonney...

53
00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:13.130
Jewelry Bonney, the pirate.

54
00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.260
Your father, Kuma...

55
00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.140
is dead!

56
00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.320
What's the situation?

57
00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.080
Anyone below the rank of commodore
can't go in, so we're in the dark...

58
00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.830
Can you believe it?

59
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.500
This newly declared Emperor
is now taking a hostage.

60
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:37.910
Yeah.

61
00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:42.410
It might be impossible for this to end
without bloodshed.

62
00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.500
It says the island is
more heavily surrounded than Ohara!

63
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.460
Is he okay?

64
00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.300
Straw Hats' Hostage Situation

65
00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.560
Dr. Vegapunk?

66
00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.310
No!

67
00:03:57.310 --> 00:04:01.720
You're not doing it right.
Keep your hands up like this and...

68
00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.320
like this!

69
00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.240
Do you understand?

70
00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.370
Cool!

71
00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.540
One more time! I wanna see it again!

72
00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:15.330
Alright, I guess it can't be helped!

73
00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.360
You greedy boys and girls!
This oughta satisfy you!

74
00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.330
Oh, what's wrong, Dragon?

75
00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:28.460
If Kuma is being driven by
a fragment of his natural instinct,

76
00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.040
where do you think he'd go, Iva?

77
00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.260
If it were me, I'd charge Mary Geoise
without a second thought,

78
00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.970
but Kuma would not.

79
00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.930
I think he'd...

80
00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.790
Now why don't you...

81
00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.610
go meet your father in the afterlife?

82
00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.710
If I'm gonna be killed anyway,

83
00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.500
I'll take you down with me!

84
00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.550
Distorted Future!

85
00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.180
Nika-Like...

86
00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.890
Nika?

87
00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.390
Future!

88
00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.170
Again...

89
00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.050
I became weaker again!

90
00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:48.720
Why?!

91
00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.890
Of course...

92
00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.960
You are his daughter.

93
00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.760
So you know that name.

94
00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.120
But...

95
00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.650
you don't know...

96
00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.150
what it is.

97
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.130
What the hell are you talking about?

98
00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.930
Apparently, she hasn't made...

99
00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.870
the connection between Nika
and Straw Hat's white appearance yet.

100
00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:35.680
What a...

101
00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.670
shame!

102
00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:47.650
Hey, who gave him food?!

103
00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:48.050
What?!

104
00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.390
N-Not us!

105
00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.190
We didn't give him anything!

106
00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.860
Put seastone cuffs on him
immediately!

107
00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:54.890
Right away, sir!

108
00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:55.520
On it!

109
00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:57.290
Get him!

110
00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.480
Stop it!

111
00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.290
This geezer...

112
00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.300
I can't even manipulate his age...

113
00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.630
Why?

114
00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:17.290
You seem to be wondering
why your power is waning.

115
00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:19.260
Bonney.

116
00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:21.960
That power of yours...

117
00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:26.510
is something I gave you.

118
00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.470
What?

119
00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.740
It was an experiment.

120
00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:41.000
To see if it was possible to...

121
00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.540
give an infant, who couldn't eat
solid fruit, power with a fruit extract.

122
00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.200
It was a success,
but the fruit itself is worthless.

123
00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:56.790
Its powers might allow you to
transform into any future...

124
00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:03.560
but the more you know of reality,
the narrower your potential becomes.

125
00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:10.430
You want to believe
Nika is real, don't you?

126
00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.140
He is real!

127
00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.640
Ever since my father was turned into
a cyborg to serve you,

128
00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.890
I've been searching for him,
hoping he'll free my father!

129
00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:24.570
Your weakening is proof that you are
starting to believe Nika is not real.

130
00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.200
Your father also believed
in this ridiculous Buccaneer legend,

131
00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.410
and said to me...

132
00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.960
"I want to save people just like Nika did!"

133
00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:49.360
It was also I who conducted
drug experiments on your mother,

134
00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:52.010
who was the eighth wife of
a fellow in the Holy Land.

135
00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.600
But those blue blemishes
showed up again, so it was a failure.

136
00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:05.620
It didn't go well at all, but it was interesting
that the side effect was inherited by her child.

137
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.580
S-Something fell from the sky!

138
00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:32.300
So it was all you...

139
00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.010
Your experiment?

140
00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.520
It was your experiment?!

141
00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:40.850
Kuma's family...

142
00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.560
was tormented by sapphire scales!

143
00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.230
He sacrificed himself for it!

144
00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.840
How could you offer him a deal
as if you were doing him a favor?!

145
00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:52.590
Come now.

146
00:09:55.930 --> 00:09:58.410
Put yourself in my shoes.

147
00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:04.130
Would you bother yourself
with the feelings of mere insects?

148
00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.680
It is inconceivable!

149
00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:24.850
What?

150
00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.280
Is it a pacifista?!

151
00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.400
N-No!

152
00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.360
He has paw pads on his hands!

153
00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.700
Don't tell me...

154
00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.700
he's the real...

155
00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.340
Reporting in!

156
00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.050
On the southwestern shore of Egghead,

157
00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:00.080
the former Warlord of the Sea,
Bartholomew Kuma has appeared!

158
00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:04.520
He's advancing towards the island's center!
The authority chip isn't working on him!

159
00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:05.710
We can't stop him!

160
00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:18.970
Kuma came?! Why?!

161
00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.680
What's all the fuss about?

162
00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.500
Kuma could not possibly be here.

163
00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.210
I can't...

164
00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.230
I'm too afraid...

165
00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.480
to say anything.

166
00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.790
Stop him! You're clear to fire!

167
00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:49.440
Yes, sir!

168
00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.910
Hey, Daddy...

169
00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.800
I feel like I'm falling apart...

170
00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.470
Maybe...

171
00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.370
Maybe it'll be...

172
00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.480
easier...

173
00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:39.000
if I just... die now...

174
00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:53.000
I'm sorry, Daddy.

175
00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:06.870
Oh, this is irritating.

176
00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:07.930
You damn brat.

177
00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.700
Shoot her in the head.

178
00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.950
– Stop it!
– Stop it!

179
00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.880
I'm sorry.

180
00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.300
Daddy.

181
00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.970
After all the effort you made
to save my life...

182
00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.690
Daddy!

183
00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:22.720
B...

184
00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.090
Bartholomew Kuma!

185
00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:33.600
Impossible!

186
00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.320
Why is this happening, Vegapunk?!

187
00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.660
He should be... He should be dead!

188
00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.040
The Buccaneer boy...

189
00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:57.290
Your lot in life is to be a slave and die.

190
00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.730
Your mother's dead...

191
00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:05.970
I think she's better off that way.

192
00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.110
Kumachi...!

193
00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:10.640
I'm so happy.

194
00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.910
I'm sorry, Kumachi.

195
00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.530
I'm dying. It won't be long.

196
00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.540
He should be dead!

197
00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:37.670
Because days after
the Revolutionary Army took him,

198
00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.810
I pressed...

199
00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.180
his self-destruct switch!

200
00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:31.140
St. Saturn!

201
00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.690
Curse you...

202
00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.230
The town...!

203
00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.700
Hey! What?! What's going on?!

204
00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.190
Kuma did this?!

205
00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.280
H-H-H...

206
00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:50.820
He punched...

207
00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.030
one of the Five Elders!

208
00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:59.290
H-H-He's one of
the highest authorities of the world!

209
00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.750
A mere slave struck
a man at the pinnacle of the world!

210
00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.640
This is an unprecedented atrocity!

211
00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:15.850
Rescue St. Saturn!
He's buried under the collapsed buildings!

212
00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.520
I can move!

213
00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:22.230
You're right! Thanks to Kuma!

214
00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.690
Bonney! Are you hurt?!

215
00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.360
This is our chance!
Take Bonney and let's make our way up!

216
00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.830
Escaping is our only objective!

217
00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.040
I'll take Kuma!

218
00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.080
Wait!

219
00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.220
What happened?

220
00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:57.930
I didn't install a self-destruct switch in you.

221
00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.680
Because if I turned you into a bomb,

222
00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.820
they might use you as a suicide weapon.

223
00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:07.790
But I followed their directions...

224
00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.830
by installing in you
a total shutdown switch instead.

225
00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.780
Now that it has been pressed,
you should be in a vegetative state,

226
00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:22.460
without will
and unable to even hear commands.

227
00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.210
You have no reason to act on,

228
00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:30.670
and it doesn't make any sense that
you came to this island where Bonney is...

229
00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.250
scientifically!

230
00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.810
So is it true then?

231
00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:45.770
It's not their physical strength
that makes Buccaneer People special.

232
00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.360
They once...

233
00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.570
It's over...

234
00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:59.470
Kuma.

235
00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.590
Where's Straw Hat?!

236
00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:08.420
We couldn't capture him and now he's gone!
How can I report this?!

237
00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.860
Thank you, Daddy!

238
00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:21.520
I saw all of your memories.

239
00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:26.480
I'm so happy, Daddy.

240
00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:29.440
Mom was such a wonderful person!

241
00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.040
And you wrote me so many letters.

242
00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:39.240
Daddy. That made me really happy.

243
00:19:42.050 --> 00:19:45.410
Even though
everyone calls you a tyrant,

244
00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:48.380
I know you were the kindest

245
00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.090
and coolest person in the world!

246
00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.760
And I'll never ever forget it!

247
00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.330
St. Saturn!

248
00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.920
Spider geezer?!

249
00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.000
He wasn't dead?!

250
00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:01.820
Hey, Vegapunk!

251
00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.780
How do you explain this?

252
00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.180
Was it your doing?

253
00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.500
I suppose it must look that way.

254
00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.670
I could say it was the power of love
if you could believe it.

255
00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.510
I see...

256
00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.940
Then it's a delusion of humanity

257
00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.340
and an error in the human body.

258
00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:34.860
Hey! How come his body is regenerating?!

259
00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.690
Farewell. I have no more use
for you people.

260
00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:40.150
Get away, Daddy!

261
00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.820
Please move!

262
00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.640
Don't make Bonney sad!

263
00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:46.720
Spider geezer!

264
00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.420
Kuma helped us, too!

265
00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:55.130
Radical...

266
00:21:56.590 --> 00:22:01.090
Indeed, you guys have grown remarkably.

267
00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.970
Beam!

268
00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.850
Go to hell already!

269
00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:16.150
Show me...

270
00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:17.820
Franky!

271
00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:19.780
your growth!

272
00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:26.950
Vegapunk!

273
00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:28.290
Daddy isn't moving!

274
00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:29.660
Kuma!

275
00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:30.790
What should I do?!

276
00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:33.670
Atlas, can you carry him to the Labophase?!

277
00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:35.630
Leave it to me!

278
00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:40.130
Atlas, move it!

279
00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:47.200
I'll handle this!

280
00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:48.720
Take care of Bonney and Kuma!

281
00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:55.310
Go!

282
00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.800
Are you going to let them go?

283
00:22:59.800 --> 00:23:01.070
I do not care.

284
00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:06.110
Oh boy...

285
00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:10.830
With even Kuma here,
we've got too many important players.

286
00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:13.370
Let's get this over with.

287
00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:18.080
You can't bear it?
You're a sad man, Kizaru.

288
00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.550
I mean, Borsalino!

289
00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.220
I'm a miserable sight, aren't I?

290
00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:31.390
I should have worn a darker pair of shades.

291
00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.350
This is an order.

292
00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:38.310
Impose sanctions on
those who defy the World Government.

293
00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:42.400
The buster call has been invoked!

294
00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.200
This island has been designated
as a threat to the World Government.

295
00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:49.740
All ships, prepare to fire!

296
00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:53.870
We'll burn everything down
in the name of justice!

297
00:23:54.760 --> 00:24:00.090
Concentrate fire
and destroy Egghead in its entirety!

298
00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:03.960
Th... The buster call?!

299
00:24:05.050 --> 00:24:08.130
Those who study the secrets of the world.

300
00:24:08.650 --> 00:24:11.850
Those who carry the blood of a lost race.

301
00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:15.310
Those who have awakened an ancient god.

302
00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:21.820
This island...

303
00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:25.360
is full of inconveniences!

304
00:24:31.700 --> 00:24:35.110
Conquering the world, believing in the future
sekai o seishite mirai o shinjite

305
00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:40.380
What did you see, what did you learn?
nani o mite nani o shitte

306
00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:48.260
Once again, I couldn't save a soul
mata daremo mamorenai no

307
00:24:48.260 --> 00:24:53.060
My fault their voices're fading away
kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei

308
00:24:53.060 --> 00:24:55.350
Don't even have time to hang my head
utsumuku hima mo nai no

309
00:24:55.350 --> 00:24:57.940
Gravel marks on my palms
tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato

310
00:24:57.940 --> 00:25:01.730
We're setting off again, my ship!
mata ugokidase boku no fune yo

311
00:25:01.730 --> 00:25:06.820
Though I can't fly in the open skies
hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo

312
00:25:06.820 --> 00:25:12.640
I can light up the deep sea
fukai umi wa teraseru kara

313
00:25:12.640 --> 00:25:13.660
Which is why...
bokura wa

314
00:25:13.660 --> 00:25:16.160
EVERYDAY owarenai
Everyday, we can't quit

315
00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:18.790
EVERYDAY makerenai
Everyday, we can't lose

316
00:25:18.790 --> 00:25:22.590
We've got something right here to defend
mamoru mono ga koko ni wa aru

317
00:25:22.590 --> 00:25:25.090
Were my predictions all wrong?
yosou chigai kamo

318
00:25:25.090 --> 00:25:27.820
But I can't stop anymore
tomarenai yo mou

319
00:25:27.820 --> 00:25:33.140
We forge on, sharing the loneliness
kodoku o ima wakeai susumu

320
00:25:33.140 --> 00:25:35.850
Don't chicken out now
ojikezukuna yo

321
00:25:35.850 --> 00:25:39.810
I'm nothing like I used to be
ano hi no boku to chigau kara

322
00:25:39.810 --> 00:25:43.790
No one can stand in my way
dare ni mo jama dekinai yo

323
00:25:43.790 --> 00:25:44.900
So move!
saa doite

324
00:25:44.900 --> 00:25:47.370
Conquering the world, believing in the future,
sekai o seishite mirai o shinjite

325
00:25:47.370 --> 00:25:49.850
counting the endless nights
ikutsumo no yoru kazoete

326
00:25:49.850 --> 00:25:52.590
What did you see, what did you learn,
nani o mite nani o shitte

327
00:25:52.590 --> 00:25:56.150
taisetsu na koto ni kizuita no
to realize what's really important?
